    "text": "For <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f20e9ad9-ac93-4720-bde9-ca0f2b1ac0a1-image.png\" style=\"width: 360px; height: 201px;\" /><br /><math><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br />For <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f0092670-1463-46c7-8fab-206ff51424de-image.png\" style=\"width: 362px; height: 198px;\" /><br /><math><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1000</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mr